  <data name="Settings_TeachingTip_Output2.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Outputs only media files: images, videos and audio, keeping only the direct contents of the materials/ and sounds/ folders (subfolders such as masks and effects are excluded); project.json and preview images are not output.

