  <data name="Settings_TeachingTip_Output3.Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Combine filters as needed.

Exclude extensions
Skip files with the given extensions.

Only keep extensions
Output only files with the given extensions.

Ignore directories
Skip everything under the given directories (including subfolders).

Only extract directories
Output only content under the given directories (including subfolders).

Filter effect images
Converted images whose transparent or black pixel ratio ≥ threshold are skipped entirely (0 = off).

Extension filters apply to both direct copies and scene-wallpaper extraction; directory filters and effect-image filtering apply to scene-wallpaper extraction only.</value>
